"cache-replacement:cache-prefetch":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"预取的行也要熬过 LRU","en":"Prefetched lines must survive LRU"},"reason":{"zh":"第 8 章预取距离超过 4 步就全部失效，原因是第 4 章的 LRU：一行预取要比 2(d−1) 个更新的行活得久，8 路装不下。","en":"Chapter 8’s prefetching fails from distance 5 on because of chapter 4’s LRU: a prefetched line must outlive 2(d−1) newer lines, more than 8 ways hold."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-cpu-caches-work/#ch8"},
