"nand-universality:ripple-carry-adder":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"加法器全由与非门搭成","en":"An adder built only from NAND"},"reason":{"zh":"第 4 章的半加器与全加器全用第 2 章的与非门拼成（半加器 6 个、全加器 15 个），稳定时间约为最长进位链的 4 倍。","en":"Chapter 4’s half and full adders are built entirely from chapter 2’s NAND gates (6 and 15), and the settling time is about four times the longest carry chain."},"source":"../computing/systems/switches-that-compute/#ch4"},
"ncq-rotational-scheduling:port-multiplier-esata-msata":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"每块盘的随机读速度","en":"Each disk's random-read rate"},"reason":{"zh":"第 7 章四块盘的随机读，用的是第 5 章排队模型给出的单盘速度。","en":"Chapter 7's four-disk random reads use the per-disk rate from chapter 5's queue model."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-sata-works/#ch7"},
"negative-numbers:twos-complement-overflow":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"无限长数轴与 256 格的圈","en":"An endless number line and a 256-position circle"},"reason":{"zh":"第 5 章引用负数页：数轴向两边无限延伸，而 8 位补码把 128–255 读成负数，数轴变成一个圈。","en":"Chapter 5 cites Negative Numbers: the number line runs forever both ways, while 8-bit two’s complement reads 128–255 as negatives and turns the line into a circle."},"source":"../computing/systems/switches-that-compute/#ch5"},
"nested-paging:thunderbolt-dma-iommu":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"给设备的页表","en":"Page tables for devices"},"reason":{"zh":"第 11 章最后一段说 IOMMU 用一套给设备的页表翻译 DMA 地址，它挡住和漏掉的在《雷电接口是怎么工作的》第 8 章。","en":"Chapter 11’s last paragraph says the IOMMU translates DMA addresses with page tables for devices; what it blocks and misses is chapter 8 of “How Thunderbolt Works”."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-virtual-memory-works/#ch11"},
"network-on-chip:die-to-die-links":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"网络跨出一块芯片","en":"The network leaves one die"},"reason":{"zh":"第 7 章的芯粒互连把第 6 章的片上网络延伸到封装里的几块芯片之间。","en":"Chapter 7's die-to-die links extend chapter 6's on-die network across several dies in one package."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-a-computer-is-wired/#ch7"},
