"numa-two-socket:contended-cache-line":{"type":"application","label":{"zh":"跨插槽时最慢","en":"Slowest across sockets"},"reason":{"zh":"第 7 章用电脑连线那篇第 4 章的双路 NUMA 说明跨插槽搬一行要两百纳秒左右。","en":"Chapter 7 uses the wiring essay’s chapter 4 on two-socket NUMA to explain the roughly 200 ns cross-socket transfer."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-cores-share-memory/#ch7"},
"numa-two-socket:network-on-chip":{"type":"connection","label":{"zh":"从插座之间到芯片内部","en":"From between sockets to inside the die"},"reason":{"zh":"第 6 章把第 4 章插座之间的点对点链路缩到芯片内部：核心之间也是一张由链路组成的网。","en":"Chapter 6 shrinks chapter 4's links between sockets to the inside of a die: cores, too, sit on a network of links."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-a-computer-is-wired/#ch6"},
"nvme-pcie-lanes-littles-law:thunderbolt-usb4-pcie-tunnel":{"type":"application","label":{"zh":"隧道里是真正的 NVMe","en":"Real NVMe through the tunnel"},"reason":{"zh":"第 8 章说 PCIe 隧道后面的盘用的是《NVMe 为什么这么快》第 2 章那样的驱动和队列。","en":"Chapter 8 says a drive behind a PCIe tunnel uses the same driver and queues as in chapter 2 of “Why NVMe Is So Fast”."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-usb-drives-talk/#ch8"},
"nvme-pcie-lanes-littles-law:uasp-command-queuing":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"队列深度","en":"Queue depth"},"reason":{"zh":"第 5 章的队列深度和《NVMe 为什么这么快》第 2 章是同一个道理：一条在等闪存时，另一条在线上。","en":"Chapter 5's queue depth is the idea of chapter 2 of “Why NVMe Is So Fast”: while one command waits for flash, another is on the wire."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-usb-drives-talk/#ch5"},
