"parallel-ata-timing-skew:8b10b-encoding":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"时钟藏进数据里","en":"Hiding the clock in the data"},"reason":{"zh":"第 2 章说明并行线的偏斜挤爆了时序窗口；第 3 章的 8b/10b 保证足够的跳变，让串行链路从数据里恢复时钟。","en":"Chapter 2 shows skew eating the parallel timing window; chapter 3's 8b/10b guarantees enough transitions for a serial link to recover the clock from the data."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-sata-works/#ch3"},
"parallel-ata-timing-skew:bus-loading-reflected-wave":{"type":"connection","label":{"zh":"并行总线的两个敌人","en":"Two enemies of a parallel bus"},"reason":{"zh":"第 2 章讲负载和反射，并把偏斜留给《SATA 为什么用了二十多年》第 2 章；那一章现在也链接回来。","en":"Chapter 2 covers loading and reflections and leaves skew to chapter 2 of “Why SATA Has Lasted Over Twenty Years”, which now links back."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-a-computer-is-wired/#ch2"},
