"pcie-channel-loss:pcie-pam4":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"损耗逼出 PAM4","en":"Loss forces PAM4"},"reason":{"zh":"第 9 章说明：频率再翻倍，第 8 章的损耗预算放不下，所以每个符号改带两比特。","en":"Chapter 9 shows why: doubling the frequency again would not fit chapter 8's loss budget, so each symbol carries two bits instead."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-pcie-works/#ch9"},
