"pcie-dma-msi:nvme-ring-doorbell-dma":{"type":"application","label":{"zh":"门铃、DMA 和 MSI-X","en":"Doorbell, DMA and MSI-X"},"reason":{"zh":"《NVMe 为什么这么快》第 4 章的门铃和完成中断，就是第 7 章的 DMA 和 MSI 用在存储上。","en":"The doorbell and completion interrupt in chapter 4 of “Why NVMe Is So Fast” are chapter 7's DMA and MSI applied to storage."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-pcie-works/#ch7"},
