"pcie-topology:pcie-enumeration":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"给树上的设备点名","en":"Naming the devices on the tree"},"reason":{"zh":"第 6 章的枚举器按深度优先走一遍第 1 章那棵由根复合体、交换芯片和端点组成的树。","en":"Chapter 6's enumerator walks, depth first, the tree of root complex, switches and endpoints from chapter 1."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-pcie-works/#ch6"},
"pcie-topology:thunderbolt-usb4-pcie-tunnel":{"type":"application","label":{"zh":"盒子里的 PCIe 交换芯片","en":"The PCIe switch in the enclosure"},"reason":{"zh":"《移动硬盘为什么跑不满》第 8 章的雷电硬盘盒里是一颗 PCIe 交换芯片，就是第 1 章树上的交换节点。","en":"The Thunderbolt enclosure in chapter 8 of “Why a USB Drive Never Hits Its Label” holds a PCIe switch, the switch node of chapter 1's tree."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-usb-drives-talk/#ch8"},
"pipeline-memory-stall:memory-hierarchy-cache-walk":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"为什么缺失延迟会跳到几百周期","en":"Why a miss penalty jumps from 1 to 200 cycles"},"reason":{"zh":"第 2 章解释第 1 章的物理原因：从片上 L1（1 ns）到片外 DRAM（80 ns）慢约 80 倍，而且硬件按整条缓存行搬运。","en":"Chapter 2 explains chapter 1's stall penalty: off-chip DRAM (~80 ns) is ~80x slower than on-chip L1 (~1 ns), and hardware fetches entire cache lines."},"source":"../computing/systems/why-compute-waits-for-memory/#ch2"},
"place-value:binary-numbers":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"满十进一与满二进一","en":"Carry at ten, carry at two"},"reason":{"zh":"第 3 章以位值与计数器为基础：十进制满十进一，二进制满二进一，位置决定分量。","en":"Chapter 3 builds on Place Value & the Counting Frame: decimal carries at ten, binary at two, and position decides weight."},"source":"../computing/systems/switches-that-compute/#ch3"},
