"tlb-and-reach:l1-size-vipt":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"TLB 和 L1 同时查","en":"TLB and L1 looked up together"},"reason":{"zh":"《CPU 的三级缓存是怎么工作的》第 7 章的 VIPT 靠的是 TLB 翻译高位时 L1 已用页内偏移选组；第 7 章链接本篇第 4 章讲 TLB。","en":"VIPT in chapter 7 of “How a CPU’s Three Levels of Cache Work” relies on L1 choosing the set from the page offset while the TLB translates; that chapter links chapter 4 here for the TLB."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-cpu-caches-work/#ch7"},
"tlb-and-reach:page-walk-cost":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"缺失一次要付的账","en":"The bill for a miss"},"reason":{"zh":"第 5 章算的是第 4 章的 TLB 没命中时，再走一遍页表要读几次内存。","en":"Chapter 5 counts the memory reads of a walk when chapter 4’s TLB misses."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-virtual-memory-works/#ch5"},
