"twos-complement-overflow:stored-program-machine":{"type":"connection","label":{"zh":"乘法溢出回到第 5 章的圈","en":"Multiplication overflow returns to chapter 5’s circle"},"reason":{"zh":"第 9 章的乘法程序算 20 × 13 得 4：8 位累加器绕过了第 5 章的 256 格圆圈（260 mod 256）。","en":"Chapter 9’s multiplication program gives 20 × 13 = 4: the 8-bit accumulator wraps around chapter 5’s 256-position circle (260 mod 256)."},"source":"../computing/systems/switches-that-compute/#ch9"},
