"vectors:graphics-pipeline":{"type":"application","label":{"zh":"点积把方向变成亮度","en":"The dot product turns direction into brightness"},"reason":{"zh":"漫反射亮度正比于 max(0, n·ℓ)：表面正对光时最亮，侧着变暗，背向光时为 0。","en":"Diffuse brightness is proportional to max(0, n·ℓ): brightest when the surface faces the light, dimmer when tilted, zero when facing away."},"source":"../computing/graphics/computer-graphics/#step2"},
